{
  "id": "八风",
  "name": "八风",
  "pinyin": "",
  "aliases": [],
  "type": "concept",
  "typeConfidence": "medium",
  "description": null,
  "mentions": [
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-02-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "，不能见渊中之鱼；师旷之聪，合八风之调，而不能听十里之外。故任一"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-03-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "不通此者，虽目数千羊之群，耳分八风之调，足蹀《阳阿》之舞，而手会"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-04-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "九十九隅，去地五亿万里；五星，八风，二十八宿，五官，六府紫宫，太"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-05-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "，赵之巨鹿，燕之昭余。\n\n何谓八风？东北曰炎风，东方曰条风，东南"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-06-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "，服苍玉，建青旗，食麦与羊，服八风水，爨其燧火。dōng宫御女青"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 18,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-18-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "合四时，叫呼而比雷霆，音气不戾八风，础伸不获五度。下至介鳞，上及"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 23,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-23-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "作乐也，皆合六律而调五音，以通八风；及其衰也，以沉湎淫康，不顾政"
    }
  ],
  "firstSeen": {
    "bookId": "huainanzi",
    "chapterIndex": 2
  }
}
